### ============================================================
###  LEADERBOARD – Spanish Poker Dice API
###  Base: http://localhost:8476/api
###
###  Supports query params:
###    sort   – elo (default) | wins | totalGames | eloChangeLastWeek | winPercentage
###    order  – desc (default) | asc
###    page   – page number (default: 1)
###    limit  – results per page (default: 10)
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8476/api


### 1. Default leaderboard (sorted by ELO, top 10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaderboard


### 2. Top players by wins
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaderboard?sort=wins


### 3. Sort by ELO change this week (most improved)
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaderboard?sort=eloChangeLastWeek


### 4. Paginated – page 1, 3 results per page
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaderboard?page=1&limit=3


### 5. Ascending ELO (lowest ranked first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaderboard?sort=elo&order=asc


### 6. Sort by win percentage
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaderboard?sort=winPercentage


### 7. Page 2 (should return remaining 2 of 12 seeded users)
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaderboard?page=2
